Package: explicaR
Title: Auto-Document Any R or Python Project
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R:
    person("Cathal", "Byrne", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "cathal470@gmail.com")
Description: Automatically documents R and Python projects by generating a
    browsable wiki, an interactive dependency graph, and a searchable code
    index — with no manual writing required. Projects become queryable from
    AI assistants such as Claude Desktop via the Model Context Protocol
    (MCP). All processing is local by default; LLM calls only occur when an
    explicit provider is supplied.
